04. PROJECT PLANNING

Project Title

LegalEaseAI – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

1. Introduction

Project planning defines the tasks, responsibilities, resources, timeline, and milestones required to complete the LegalEaseAI project successfully.

2. Team Structure

The project consists of four members.

Member 1 – AI and Model Research

Responsibilities:

1. Research suitable Generative AI models.
2. Design prompts.
3. Develop document-generation logic.
4. Test AI-generated output.

Member 2 – Backend Development

Responsibilities:

1. Develop the FastAPI backend.
2. Create application routes.
3. Process user input.
4. Integrate the AI model.
5. Maintain app.py.

Member 3 – Frontend Development

Responsibilities:

1. Design the user interface.
2. Create HTML pages.
3. Develop CSS styling.
4. Implement Jinja2 templates.
5. Connect UI with backend.

Member 4 – Testing and Documentation

Responsibilities:

1. Prepare test cases.
2. Test application features.
3. Record test results.
4. Prepare project documentation.
5. Maintain GitHub files.

